<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - FOOTSTAR RAISED TO BUY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - FOOTSTAR RAISED TO BUY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Footstar Inc to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Thursday, Footstar posted a 3.8 percent increase in July same-store sales.</p>
<p>-- Footstar gained 13/16 to 27-3/4.</p>
</text>
